---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="星靈選物 — 星靈織語 Starwoven"
  description="精選二手牌卡、礦石水晶、手作飾品與寄售良品，陪伴你在日常生活中感受溫柔能量。"
  theme="light"
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#2E2A4F] tracking-wider">星靈選物</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#3A3A3A]/80 leading-relaxed">
        每一件器物與水晶，都承載著一段獨特的心靈頻率。
      </p>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#80A9D4] mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </header>

    <!-- Categories Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      {[
        { title: '二手牌卡', desc: '經過淨化與整理的塔羅與神諭卡，等待下一位有緣的主人。' },
        { title: '礦石水晶', desc: '天然原礦、晶簇與滾石，為您的生活空間注入穩定場域。' },
        { title: '手作飾品', desc: '結合七脈輪與直覺設計的手串、項鍊與能量編織物。' },
        { title: '寄售良品', desc: '星靈夥伴與同頻創作者的精選香氛、調香噴霧與手作品。' },
      ].map((cat) => (
        <div class="bg-white/80 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#80A9D4]/20 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#2E2A4F] mb-2">{cat.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#3A3A3A]/75 leading-relaxed">{cat.desc}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-xs text-[#80A9D4] font-medium">
            現貨供應中
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- External Shop Notice & Redirect Button -->
    <div class="text-center bg-white/80 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-[#80A9D4]/25 max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto rounded-full bg-[#80A9D4]/15 flex items-center justify-center text-[#80A9D4]">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2E2A4F] mb-2">線上賣場：7-11 iOpen Mall</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#3A3A3A]/85 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          星靈選物目前於 7-11 iOpen Mall 平台提供線上便利取貨付款服務。點選下方按鈕前往賣場瀏覽最新上架品項！
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a
          href="https://mall.iopenmall.tw/117352/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#80A9D4] hover:bg-[#6b97c4] text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-base font-medium shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-95"
        >
          <span>前往 7-11 iOpen Mall 賣場</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 pt-2">
        （本頁面已預留未來升級自建電商商城之底層架構）
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
